so I think it's important that you
really like whatever you're doing.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.360
Uh, if you don't like it... life is too short.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:49.120
If you like what you're doing, you think about it even when you're not working.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.380
I mean it's-- it's-- it's-- something that your mind is drawn to.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:58.060
Um, and... and if you don't like it, you
just really can't make it work, I think.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.720
So many people try to talk me out of starting our own company, it was crazy.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.280
One good friend of mine,

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.720
collected a whole series of videos of rocket blowing up

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.000
and made me watch those.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.740
He's just didn't want me to lose all my money.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:14.280
We're doing these things that, uh, seem unlikely to succeed.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.200
and we've been fortunate, and,

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.500
at least thus far, they HAVE succeeded.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.580
Now is the time to take risk, you don't have kids--

