existing market place

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.410
against large, entrenched, competitors

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.080
then,

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.380
your product or service needs to be much better than theirs.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.820
It can't be a little bit better

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:35.480
because then you put yourself in the shoes of the consumer,

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.600
and they say "Why would you buy it?" (as a consumer.)

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.340
You're always gonna buy the trusted brand,

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.020
